{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ec95ad16-e361-8e1b-89a7-3631508272cf",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T13:39:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Pagan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good afternoon. I want to report a problem with the road. The edge of the road is crumbling, at a curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The edge of the road is crumbling at a curve. Okay. Can you tell me where that is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 91 Kay Street. Right there where the street bends."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "91 Kay Street, at the bend. And is that on the pavement edge, by the curb, or is it more along the side where the pavement meets the dirt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Where the pavement meets the, the side. No curb right there. Pieces are breaking off, going into the gutter line. Gutter line, yes. It got worse after the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the storm. You mean the nor'easter, last weekend, Saturday into Sunday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that one. Saturday into Sunday. I noticed it Monday morning, and today it looks bigger."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so noticed Monday, bigger today. About how much of the road is affected? Is it a few feet, or longer than that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few feet, I would say. Maybe a car length. A car length. And it's eating in toward the lane, a little more each day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, a car length and moving toward the lane. Is it a spot where cars are driving close to it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:08-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's on a bus route. The bus comes around that curve, and it has to swing wide. Swing wide, so it gets close to the broken part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's important, I'll note that it's a bus route. Let me get that down. Crumbling road edge at the curve, 91 Kay Street, bus route, got worse since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. That's correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And may I have your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rafael Pagan. P-A-G-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rafael Pagan, P-A-G-A-N. Is it Rafael with an F or a PH?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "With an F. R-A-F-A-E-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And do you live at 91 Kay Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I rent there. I rent. I'm calling from work right now, though. I work nights at the front desk of a hotel, and I'm in the lobby. It's quiet at the moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you're at the hotel lobby now. If we need to reach you, is there a number that's best?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one I'm on is the hotel's. Better to use my home number. It's 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197. Let me read that back to be sure. Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Oh one nine seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Now, I'll send this to the road crew supervisor so someone can go look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Someone can look at it. Good. Can I ask, how long do repairs like this usually take? How long, usually."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It really varies. After a storm like that, a lot of calls come in at once, so crews have to go in order. They'll look at it first and decide what kind of repair it needs. A quick patch can be fairly fast, but if the edge needs more work it can take longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Longer if it needs more work. I see. So a patch could be quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And because it's on a bus route, I'll flag that so it gets looked at sooner rather than later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sooner rather than later. Thank you. I sleep in the daytime, so I don't always answer, but I will check the messages."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:39:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. If we miss you, we'll leave a message. Is there anything else you want me to add about the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:39:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only that it's right at the bend. Right at the bend, on the outside edge. That's the part that is breaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The outside edge of the bend. Got it. I've got all of that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:39:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then that's all I need. Thank you, miss."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pagan. Have a good rest of your shift."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T13:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rest of my shift. Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
